"is :file:`Qubes-R{X}-86_64.iso.asc`, where :samp:`{X}` is a specific release "
"of Qubes. The signature filename is always the same as the ISO filename "
"followed by ``.asc``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:331
#: ecd2cbbe19b5442fac7016ab39a0a583
msgid ""
"**Download both the ISO and its signature file**. Put both of them **in the "
"same directory**, then navigate to that directory. Now, you can verify the "
"ISO by executing this GPG command in the directory that contains both files, "
"make sure to replace :samp:`Qubes-R{X}` by the correct release number "
"(i.e.: :samp:`Qubes-R{4.3}`):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:344
#: c1cf5e063f01459d923f09158e3c593a
msgid ""
